# 2026-11-18 · B3 iso-compute vote on dev: Qwen3-VL-4B (reader A, expert hint ON as in S) sampled k = 3 times,
# majority vote (tie -> higher summed confidence). k = 3 >= the calls of S per question on dev:
# readers 2 x 3,937 + reopens 1,457 + judge 1,071 = 10,402 calls / 3,937 questions = 2.64 (+ 836 critic calls per image).
# Same as B1 except the k samples: only reader A votes, no expert vote, no verifier, no judge.
# Usage: set -a; source configs/2026-11-17_small_models.env; source configs/2026-11-18_dev_B3_k3.env; set +a
#        mkdir -p outputs/dev_B3_k3 && cp -r outputs/dev_full_S/1_expert outputs/dev_B3_k3/   # reuse the expert pass
#        PYTHONPATH=src .venv/bin/python -m inspector.main --split dev --steps expert,reader_a,aggregator --run-name dev_B3_k3
ONEREF_READER_SAMPLES=3
ONEREF_READER_TEMPERATURE=0.7
ONEREF_AGGREGATE_READERS='["reader_a"]'
ONEREF_EXPERT_WEIGHT_DISCRIMINATION=0
ONEREF_JUDGE_MODE=off
